  </div>

  <!-- ── SLIDE 6: EDGE SCHEMA ── -->
  <div class="slide" id="slide-6">
    <div class="label">05 — Edge Design</div>
    <div class="section-title">
      <div class="num">05</div>
      <h2>Explicit Edge Collection</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2" style="flex:1; gap:32px;">
      <div>
        <h3>Edge Document Shape</h3>
        <div class="code">{
  <span class="k">"_id"</span>: <span class="s">"edge_uuid"</span>,
  <span class="k">"from"</span>: { <span class="n">"id"</span>: <span class="s">"file_abc"</span>, <span class="n">"type"</span>: <span class="s">"File"</span> },
  <span class="k">"to"</span>:   { <span class="n">"id"</span>: <span class="s">"APP_XYZ001"</span>, <span class="n">"type"</span>: <span class="s">"App"</span> },
  <span class="k">"relationship"</span>: <span class="s">"LISTS_APP"</span>,

  <span class="k">"context"</span>: {
    <span class="n">"sector"</span>:   <span class="s">"SECTOR_A"</span>,
    <span class="n">"pageId"</span>:   <span class="s">"page_001"</span>,
    <span class="n">"pageDate"</span>: <span class="s">"2024-03-15"</span>
  },

  <span class="k">"metadata"</span>: {
    <span class="n">"sourceFile"</span>:  <span class="s">"impact_list.xlsx"</span>,
    <span class="n">"fileType"</span>:    <span class="s">"excel"</span>,
    <span class="n">"confidence"</span>:  <span class="v">1.0</span>,
    <span class="n">"extractedBy"</span>: <span class="s">"excel_parser"</span>
  },

  <span class="k">"createdAt"</span>: <span class="s">"2025-05-20T00:00:00Z"</span>
}</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Why Explicit Edges</h3>
        <ul class="styled" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
          <li><strong>Denormalized context</strong> — sector, pageId, pageDate on every edge. No joins needed for filtered traversal.</li>
          <li><strong>Multi-hop queries</strong> — App → File → Row → Page → Sector in one aggregation pipeline.</li>
          <li><strong>Provenance</strong> — every AppID association traceable to parser and source file.</li>
          <li><strong>ADK agent tools</strong> — scoped queries become simple <code style="color:var(--accent)">edges.find()</code> calls.</li>
        </ul>
        <h3>MongoDB Indexes</h3>
        <div class="code"><span class="c">// Outbound / inbound traversal</span>
{ <span class="n">"from.id"</span>: 1, <span class="k">"relationship"</span>: 1 }
{ <span class="n">"to.id"</span>: 1, <span class="k">"relationship"</span>: 1 }

<span class="c">// Sector-scoped + recency</span>
{ <span class="n">"context.sector"</span>: 1, <span class="k">"relationship"</span>: 1,
  <span class="n">"context.pageDate"</span>: <span class="v">-1</span> }

<span class="c">// App lookup newest-first</span>
{ <span class="n">"to.id"</span>: 1, <span class="n">"context.sector"</span>: 1,
  <span class="n">"context.pageDate"</span>: <span class="v">-1</span> }</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── SLIDE 7: INGESTION PIPELINE ── -->
