        </div>
        <div class="flow-step">
          <div class="step-num">PHASE 5</div>
          <div class="step-title">Retrieve</div>
          <div class="step-sub">LightRAG dual<br>Recency rank<br>ADK tools</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-2" style="flex:1; gap:24px;">
      <div>
        <h3>Phase 3 — Strict Insert Order</h3>
        <ul class="styled">
          <li><strong>Step 1</strong> — Parse HTML → Page, Tables, Rows, Paragraphs, edges</li>
          <li><strong>Step 2</strong> — Normalize RowTypes → update Rows, create RowType nodes</li>
          <li><strong>Step 3</strong> — Detect file refs in rows → create File nodes (status: PENDING)</li>
          <li><strong>Step 4</strong> — Parse each file → create App nodes (upsert), LISTS_APP edges</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Failure Handling</h3>
        <table class="tbl">
          <thead><tr><th>Failure</th><th>File Status</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td>Parse error</td><td><span class="tag red">FAILED</span></td><td>Log, flag for review</td></tr>
            <tr><td>No AppIDs found</td><td><span class="tag amber">NO_APPS_FOUND</span></td><td>Log, keep File node</td></tr>
            <tr><td>OCR low confidence</td><td><span class="tag amber">LOW_CONFIDENCE</span></td><td>Discard, flag</td></tr>
            <tr><td>PPT mostly images</td><td><span class="tag purple">PARTIAL</span></td><td>Title + notes only</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
